==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[baby-sitter]]

===Etymology===
[[baby]] + [[sitter]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who cares for one or more babies or children for a short period of time in place of their [[legal guardian]]s.
#* ''My neighbor is sometimes a '''babysitter''' for other moms' children.''

====Related terms====
* [[babysit]]
* [[house-sitter]]

